      "message": "test(ui): AI chat pump helpers step instead of run to survive scroll repaints\n\nThe post-merge gate failed on post_confirmation_allow_and_deny_gate_mcp_dispatch:\nHarness::run exceeded max_steps (4) in pump_until_idle, because a\nscroll-area repaint keeps going on a slow runner. The gate under test is\nunchanged. The helpers now call step() in the wait loops.\n\nFixes #2137\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
